 rham\, North Carolina natives Mique (Tahmique Cameron) and Solomon Fox (
 Gabe Fox-Peck). The two have spent a decade performing together\, captiv
 ating audiences across the nation with their unique blend of hip-hop\, s
 oul\, funk\, and R&B.\n\nThe group’s undeniable talent has led to over
  5\,000\,000 streams across platforms and opportunities to tour and open
